              "numbering": "18.15",
              "text": "18.15 Insurance. Array shall maintain, at its own expense, throughout the Term and for one (1) year thereafter: commercial general liability insurance (including product liability and contractual liability coverage) of not less than USD 1,000,000 per occurrence and USD 2,000,000 in the aggregate; professional liability (errors and omissions) insurance of not less than USD 2,000,000; where Array processes Ono Confidential Information or personal data, cyber liability insurance of not less than USD 5,000,000; and workers' compensation insurance as required by applicable Law. Array shall provide Ono with certificates of insurance evidencing such coverage upon request."
